* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RLIACE - List all active Reports for a specific report mailed to
*          a specific UserID (User Type = g) or list all active Reports
*          for a specific report definition (User Type = A)
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd p(999999)     ......
* mrs 93-08-04 s(999999)     created
* mrs 93-10-05 s(999999)     check if source exists
* mrs 93-11-24 s(999999)     top, bot implemented
* mrs 93-12-13 s(999999)     'nnn records scanned' window added
* mrs 94-02-15 s(999999)     date selection
* mrs 94-05-05 s(999999)     use owner implemented
* mrs 94-05-17 s(999999)     reduce sort fliplines
* gw  96-10-15 s(231722)     TOP doesn't go top
* mrs 97-04-29 P(162205)     long description screen and PF10/PF11 added
